{"id":"410647","name":"小白菜豆腐汤","author":"Anna_vam","authorId":"6720441","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/410647/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"小白菜","amount":"一捆"},{"name":"嫩豆腐","amount":"一盒"},{"name":"葱","amount":"1/5"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"少许"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"小白菜清洗干净。","img":"images/410647/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成段备用。","img":"images/410647/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"嫩豆腐。","img":"images/410647/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"嫩豆腐切块备用。","img":"images/410647/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"葱切葱花。","img":"images/410647/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中放入少许油，放入葱花爆香。","img":"images/410647/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入小白菜煸炒出水份后，倒入适量水，加入适量盐。","img":"images/410647/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"水烧开后，放入豆腐煮开，出锅前加入少许鸡精。","img":"images/410647/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"出锅啦~~~可以喝啦。~~","img":"images/410647/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}